# resid-test: test01 — Normal ADSR cycle
# Source: https://github.com/libsidplayfp/resid-test/blob/master/tests/test01
# AD=0x12 (Attack=1, Decay=2), SR=0x84 (Sustain=8→0x88, Release=4)
# Exercises full attack-decay-sustain-release cycle.

reset

# Set AD register for voice 3
write, 0x13, 0x12
run, 3

# Set SR register for voice 3
write, 0x14, 0x84
run, 3

# Gate ON — start attack
write, 0x12, 0x01
run, 5000

# Gate OFF — start release
write, 0x12, 0x00
run, 55000

# Note: with exponential decay at rate 4, full release from ~0x9C takes ~80000
# cycles. After 55000, envelope is still partially decaying (correct behavior).

end
